5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's find that werewolf quickly. I'm ready to lead the way!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,Let us remain calm. A hasty decision is often a wrong one.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,I agree with George! Let's all be friendly and figure this out together.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll just observe for now.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,This is like a real adventure! I'm so excited! Who do you think is the bad guy?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, don't be too hasty. We need to listen to everyone's behavior first.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,Indeed. Observation is the key to uncovering the truth.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm sure we can trust each other if we just talk it out!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
14,0,2,talk,Rin,,But it's more fun to guess! I bet it's someone who's being too quiet!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Being quiet isn't proof of anything. Let's see how people react tomorrow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"A sound approach, Takumi.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll support whoever is trying their best to help the village!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
