31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Listen up! I know who the werewolf is. It's Yumi!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"That is a very bold claim for the first day, Takumi.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"What?! Takumi, why would you say that? I'm just trying to be helpful!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"That was sudden. Takumi, are you the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Rin,,Whoa! A reveal already? This is getting intense! Is Yumi really the wolf?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Yes, I'm the Seer! I checked Yumi last night, and she's the werewolf!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"If you are the Seer, your information is vital. But we must be sure.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm not the werewolf! I'm just a normal girl! Takumi is lying to us!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Takumi is lying, he's either the werewolf or the possessed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Rin,,But Takumi looks so confident! I think he's telling the truth!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't lie about things like this! Yumi, stop pretending!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"@Yumi, do you have any explanation for why Takumi would target you specifically?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I don't! I've been nothing but nice to everyone! Please believe me!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"It's a classic conflict. However, the Seer's role is too powerful to ignore.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Rin,,I believe Takumi! Let's get the werewolf now!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Let's vote Yumi. We can end this right now.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,I am inclined to trust the Seer's divination.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Please, don't do this! You're making a huge mistake!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll go with the majority. Yumi it is.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Bye-bye, werewolf!","{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
